oView", "TwoViewVr", "Duo", "DuoSolutions"], "long_description": "The Two View VR App is the first virtual reality application designed to be in the hands of your commercial and internal teams. It allows construction companies to collect data on customer attribution, effort, and sales team engagement. It also enables internal teams to align strategies through our data intelligence and attribution system, delivering an incredible neuro-visual experience to your client\u2014encouraging purchases and ensuring confidence in decision-making.", "short_description": "Take your venture with you wherever you go!\nWherever you are, with DuoSolutions' tool, your venture will be there too!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1279385497187820", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TwoViewVR", "keywords": ["TwoView", "TwoViewVR", "Duo", "Duosolutions"], "long_description": "O Aplicativo Two View Vr \u00e9 o primeiro aplicativo de realidade virtual, que estar\u00e1 na m\u00e3o do seu time comercial e interno, onde a construtora consegue coletar dados sobre a atribui\u00e7\u00e3o do seu cliente, esfor\u00e7o e comprometimento do seu comercial, e ainda permite alinhar estrat\u00e9gias para sua equipe interna atrav\u00e9s da nossa intelig\u00eancia de dados e atribui\u00e7\u00e3o. Trazendo uma incr\u00edvel experi\u00eancia neuro visual ao seu cliente, para incentivo de compra e seguran\u00e7a na tomada de decis\u00e3o.", "short_description": "Leve seu empreendimento para onde quer que v\u00e1!\nOnde voc\u00ea estiver com a ferramenta da DuoSolutions seu empreendimento tamb\u00e9m estar\u00e1!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://groupduosolutions.com.br/politicas-privacidade-duo-solutions.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GroupDuoSolutions", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://groupduosolutions.com.br/site/", "category": null, "c